# core.autocrlf cannot be relied on here: on the development machine a global
# `false` overrides a system `true`, so with the effective value `false` git
# normalises nothing on `add` and CRLF that reaches the working tree gets
# committed verbatim. Normalise every text file to LF in the repo and on
# checkout, regardless of platform or any per-machine autocrlf setting.
* text=auto eol=lf
